{"id": "70310", "title": "我的男人不可说", "author": "苏行乐", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 33, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70310/70310s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70310.htm", "intro": "【文案女主篇：】\r\n    赫赫有名的段之青看上了平安，这个消息惊羡了一众洛家亲戚。\r\n    然而作为当事人，对于段之青给予自己的这份荣宠，洛平安只是觉得如履薄冰。\r\n    【读者须知及作者大排雷：】\r\n    1，第一章女主性格就已显现，不能接受或看着有点膈应的赶紧点叉，及时止损，别自虐；\r\n    2，作者已团购大批狗血，将瓢泼撒在本文中，不能接受狗血小白文的赶紧点叉；\r\n    3，代入感太强，心理承受能力太差，公主病，玻璃心，分不清小说和现实的读者请勿入；\r\n    4，作者非包子，人敬我一尺我还人一丈，不客气者会不客气还击，双标党退散。已向无视阶段发展；\r\n    5，虽然以上内容看起来比较强硬，但请原谅一个作者的无奈，鞠躬。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70310", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "回家", "file": "10926007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "家教", "file": "10926008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初见", "file": "10926009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "蚯蚓", "file": "10926010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "午饭", "file": "10926011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "男友", "file": "10926012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "金主", "file": "10926013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "变脸", "file": "10926014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "监控", "file": "10926015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "裙子", "file": "10926016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "纠缠", "file": "10926017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "受伤", "file": "10926018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "泼妇", "file": "10926019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "遇难", "file": "10926020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "出手", "file": "10926021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "提议", "file": "10926022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "自强", "file": "10926023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人渣", "file": "10926024.html", "available": false}, {"title": "进门", "file": "10926025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "出事", "file": "10926026.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10926027.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10926028.htm